{"ID":"20240515131438-eo4lsu4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131438-eo4lsu4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131438-eo4lsu4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133614-qlsfxgm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133614-qlsfxgm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:642,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515133614-qlsfxgm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:455,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:455\u0026#125;","title":"026","type":"doc","updated":"20240515153402"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515133614-qlsfxgm","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 860px;","id":"20240515133614-qlsfxgm","updated":"20240515153402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CK"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"40  中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/13"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：四個月前開刀切除一在左眉上方的腫瘤，之後被診斷為癌(一種慢性成長的癌)。其額頭的腫塊自2000開始即有。之後用西藥Gleevec三個月，讓她非常不適，失眠，憂鬱，倦怠，嘔心。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"月經提前來，這一次21天(以前不記得了)。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每次月經來人就很憂鬱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便三天一次。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便中黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"排氣無。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足冷，手溫。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴有，喜冷飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下午以後身熱加重，睡時身熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前額手術處無痛或輕痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：脈細小無力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：淡白黃，苔薄，牙痕多\n2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷：  上熱下焦也熱，寒熱並結。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃連兩銭，黃芩三銭，白芍五錢，阿膠三錢分三包(烊盡)，厚朴兩銭，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"枳實兩銭，大黃三錢，芒硝三錢分三包(沖服)，玉金五錢，柴胡三錢，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天花三錢，麥冬三錢，半夏三錢，乾薑兩銭，陽起石三錢。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服時加蛋黃一只入內沖服。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n主方為黃連阿膠湯加大承氣湯。\n額頭屬陽明，大腸亦屬陽明。大腸便秘產生燥氣故額頭長腫瘤。\n因不確定脈細小是否為寒，故先不開大量熱藥。\n心火受肺氣之肅降移熱小腸，今病人上熱，必使肺太過乾燥，就像車子的radiator缺水，故用潤肺之藥，亦用疏肝之藥。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}